<title>BRAZIL: Brazil reschedules CVRD auction for May 6.</title>
<headline>Brazil reschedules CVRD auction for May 6.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's National Development Bank (BNDES) has set May 6 as the new date for the auction of mining conglomerate Companhia Vale do Rio Doce (CVRD), a spokesman said on Monday.</p>
